### 2. GitLab Integration Configuration
```java
@Configuration
public class GitLabConfig {
    @Value("${gitlab.token}")
    private String gitlabToken;
    
    @Bean
    public Feign.Builder gitlabFeignBuilder() {
        return Feign.builder()
                .encoder(new FormEncoder(new JacksonEncoder()))
                .decoder(new JacksonDecoder())
                .requestInterceptor(template -> template.header("PRIVATE-TOKEN", gitlabToken));
    }
}
```

### 3. GitLab Service Interface
```java
@FeignClient(name = "gitlab", url = "${gitlab.url}", configuration = GitLabConfig.class)
public interface GitLabClient {
    @PostMapping("/api/v4/projects/{projectId}/issues")
    GitLabIssue createIssue(
        @PathVariable("projectId") String projectId,
        @RequestParam Map<String, ?> queryMap
