### 4. AI Document Search Service
```java
@Service
public class AISearchService {
    private final OpenAiService openAiService;
    private final VectorStore vectorStore;

    public AISearchService(OpenAiService openAiService) {
        this.openAiService = openAiService;
        this.vectorStore = new SimpleVectorStore(); // Replace with actual vector DB
    }

    public String searchDocuments(String query) {
        List<Double> queryEmbedding = openAiService.createEmbedding(query);
        List<Document> results = vectorStore.search(queryEmbedding, 3);
        return results.stream()
                .map(Document::getContent)
                .collect(Collectors.joining("\n\n"));
    }
}
```

